#: energy.cpp:154
msgid ""
"<h1>Display Power Control</h1> <p>If your display supports power saving "
"features, you can configure them using this module.</p> <p>There are three "
"levels of power saving: standby, suspend, and off. The greater the level of "
"power saving, the longer it takes for the display to return to an active "
"state.</p> <p>To wake up the display from a power saving mode, you can make "
"a small movement with the mouse, or press a key that is not likely to cause "
"any unintentional side-effects, for example, the \"Shift\" key.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Milinowa kontrola za wobrazowku</h1> <p>Jeli ma Waša wobrazowka móžnosće "
"lutowanja miliny, móžeće je z tutym modulom připrawić.</p><p>Su tři runiny "
"lutowanja miliny: standby, wusnyć a hasnyć. Wjetše je lutowanje a dlěje "
"traje, doniž njeje wobrazowka zaso aktiwna.</p><p>Za wubudźenje wobrazowki z "
"modusa lutowanja dosaha pohib z myšku abo stłóčenje tasty, kiž nima dalše "
"efekty, kaž \"Wulkopis\".</p>"

#: energy.cpp:176
msgid "&Enable display power management"
msgstr "&Lutowanje miliny zaswěćić"

#: energy.cpp:179
msgid "Check this option to enable the power saving features of your display."
msgstr ""
"Markěrujće tutu opciju, hdyž chceće milinu lutowace móžnosće swojeje "
"wobrazowki wužic."

#: energy.cpp:182
msgid "Your display does not support power saving."
msgstr "Waša wobrazowka lutowanje miliny njepodpěruje."

#: energy.cpp:190
msgid "Learn more about the Energy Star program"
msgstr "Wjace wo Energy Star-programje nawuknyć"

#: energy.cpp:200
msgid "&Standby after:"
msgstr "&Standby po:"

#: energy.cpp:202 energy.cpp:213 energy.cpp:225
msgid " min"
msgstr "mjeń"

#: energy.cpp:203
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Disabled"
msgctxt "Disables display entering standby mode after x min"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Znjepřistupnjene"

#: energy.cpp:206
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"standby\" mode. This is the first level of power saving."
msgstr ""
"Postajće čas bjez aktiwitow, po kotrymž so wobrazowka do \"standby\"-modusa "
"poda. To je prěnja runina lutowanja miliny."

#: energy.cpp:211
msgid "S&uspend after:"
msgstr "W&usnyć po:"

#: energy.cpp:214
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Disabled"
msgctxt "Disables display entering suspend mode after x min"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Znjepřistupnjene"

#: energy.cpp:217
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should enter "
"\"suspend\" mode. This is the second level of power saving, but may not be "
"different from the first level for some displays."
msgstr ""
"Postajće čas bjez aktiwitow, po kotrymž so wobrazowka \"wusnje\". To je "
"druha runina lutowanja miliny, ale za někotre wobrazowki njeje to ničo druhe "
"hač \"standby\"."

#: energy.cpp:223
msgid "&Power off after:"
msgstr "&Hasnyć po:"

#: energy.cpp:226
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Disabled"
msgctxt "Disables display being turned off after x min"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Znjepřistupnjene"

#: energy.cpp:229
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the display should be powered "
"off. This is the greatest level of power saving that can be achieved while "
"the display is still physically turned on."
msgstr ""
"Postajće čas bjez aktiwitow, po kotrymž so wobrazowka hasnje. To je "
"najwjetša runina lutowanja miliny, hdyž je wobrazowka fyzikalisce hišće "
"zaswěćena."
